.vscode/
.vscode-test/
*.code-workspace

IntelliJ / WebStorm / PhpStorm / RubyMine
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr
out/

Sublime Text
*.sublime-project
*.sublime-workspace

Atom
.atom/
*.atom

Vim
*.swp
*.swo
*.un~
*.tmp

Emacs
~
##
.#*

